{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:d33f9af2bfec1f7b0a06b267c4893b13d0ee9f9a38c88c00fb89aad91b48a683",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43591d643b71e9789318a3e88613a86ff14cf4966a504802c5ebbfdf5c6dd457",
      "text": "甜甜圈推荐派对！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35352ee99bed8e11e8e675fe3238339c192eb6784850e8b9b80ee3c9f645ffee",
      "text": "隼人等人为了春名的生日，开始筹备派对。\n四季提议礼物就送甜甜圈，\n于是在当天，大家各自带了自己觉得最好吃的\n甜甜圈来……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_a:cmd-000022:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_a:cmd-000022:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43591d643b71e9789318a3e88613a86ff14cf4966a504802c5ebbfdf5c6dd457",
      "text": "甜甜圈推荐派对！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:630010023a09c8f4dac580883f9d5a8d69e342b21681aedc03cab2c96b3faa0b",
      "text": "快到……春名的生日……了呢。\n大家一起……给他庆祝，对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ddba9ff168cadad9f07d10cae331428d8236bbfa05eeecba0a2e431f21904984",
      "text": "话说回来，已经到了这个时候啊。\n那么，两位有什么想法吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_a:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a1e54d489f1a9ebf8a2e5b2abbc17b49832d89ba2d7cb93a9a0ab61798a8e2f",
      "text": "春名亲的生日，想办得Mega嗨翻天呢！\n怎么庆祝比较好呢～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_a:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abca47b538f9490fd1c6571ddb7ad2411bbaffb364aaa0a3563078e059c2aca1",
      "text": "正好春名补考不在，\n趁现在大家商量一下吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_a:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4720e64947a92ecd90801997db3f83a5848751d4e10eb61dfa3565fefcf676b0",
      "text": "说到底，我本来是希望他\n不要沦落到补考的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_a:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b599f337ee1b45f8f59fae8ee54ac9d1bab32c234911d6ef8a9fdb0b051737f9",
      "text": "首先，派对场地去拜托制作人酱，\n借用事务所怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_a:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e533e047dfbc760f7d755878d2f5f7d26fc5d6422ccf37673716cdcd5c7cec6f",
      "text": "也是呢……去拜托制作人吧。\n然后，礼物是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_a:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfee521eba2860a2ba59dc638350d0e5a1b245dee45e00eff9d7d531463e72bc",
      "text": "那当然是甜甜圈了吧！\n非它莫属了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_a:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1607846f8736bda66327aa5b4d8943c7aeedef1886b2784b81a7cc8a47202f0",
      "text": "赞成！既然这样，不如每个人都各自准备一份\n自己觉得最好吃的甜甜圈，怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_a:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40a8573ebc80dab1232f05b984b58211842f48dd6525bf14ac590c92bc4818cb",
      "text": "喔，好主意！\n我要选出四季专属的最佳甜甜圈～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_a:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a664be802fc4d8dedacdf9caa4486e8daab739bb8a15f2a85683f8920a6a1fea",
      "text": "……这样的话，为了选拔，我们不也得\n吃大量的甜甜圈吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_a:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4004e213c107cff18f53a7db6f824acb192822ad326e53bd56559c7d1f0efe6c",
      "text": "哎、哎呀，在力所能及的范围内啦！\n大家都去找找各自喜欢的甜甜圈吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_a:cmd-000148:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4da9103dd6a36ae112d7240ac6bdbc45997e102409cc7f7d5057099b700f9b33",
      "text": "嗯……也去拜托一下……\n制作人吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_b:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87096b6b211f24d2e3a5b80900384eb15152fb0244d7e290ca6cdecd6d7e3535",
      "text": "好～嘞，今天也要好好练习啦。\n大家辛苦了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53be048e24f85177b99088c0992b3e7d7f36c0863f24eddc832528188b9a1cd5",
      "text": "嗯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5a9e1dd1bebd7c3319aaba2130f94adebe4052e4337cd1dc0546c13326ab54e",
      "text": "唔咕、唔咕……咕嘟。\n呜！咳、咳咳、咳咳……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:625d3e36fbf84ef7f88ac0bd8cf3a29f37a5741ac0619086efccbeed37c10766",
      "text": "真是的，你在干什么呢。\n来，喝茶。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_b:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e5a050be5739d3e7ef11afabb54f63e22c149683b258528f0731e735e11d04b",
      "text": "抱歉，难道是我吓到你了吗？\n隼人，没事吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_b:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:236ec643c6009b02602a1c663e6fb410b066b36a192621c96b334467bca008a3",
      "text": "唔咕咕……咳，没事……\n只是不小心噎到了而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_b:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9db6d7eeff748f7b04d612997ad12343975c6337a0545ca21a9c8ad71c0dd877",
      "text": "没事就好……嗯？\n那个盒子，难道你刚才在吃甜甜圈？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_b:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4511fb5889e09a9f1f019c8f6b29bf44fc1787c3a8cd25248253ba02baf28d03",
      "text": "没、没有啦，就是那样！\n受春名的影响，突然很想吃嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_b:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6083e3be28b468782964d2b9d33441b7a955e3168993134acaee10404394e7c",
      "text": "啊～…因为肚子饿了所以急急忙忙塞进嘴里了。\n啊哈，啊哈哈哈……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_b:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5ad04f7bbfae691507d4a21bccc36ad3893a1cac55ece93d2a3daa248327e0f",
      "text": "这样啊！隼人也体会到甜甜圈的美妙之处了啊。\n我也带了甜甜圈来，一起吃吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_b:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:611359b1b1de8cac652d3598b810a97f06bae3efb30503f4a32d1a6305b19163",
      "text": "哎，我才刚吃完……\n没有啦，谢啦！我收下了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_b:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e56bc01ff77cf63a85e477cda00aedbf4f4055e1f6493be4eca4808fbcb28621",
      "text": "多吃点补充体力吧！\n那我先去给架子鼓调音啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_b:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f4e732435ceb006c565176fadc2ea6d429a7360cd9529c3ec9d6082afeda2b0",
      "text": "……呼，还好蒙混过去了。\n下次挑选甜甜圈得选好地方才行了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_b:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d64602ae45ddcc9f1450f04c40a55042e8237d1cbbd5bbc641ad0f8aac80ab07",
      "text": "你蒙混的手段也太可疑了吧，隼人……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_c:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b04d1a7e3857137af3bfde634359a46fbbc08694658cd0904fb1b0d22785a729",
      "text": "辛苦了，制作人。\n今天的碰头会啊……咦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_c:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9e17ae26478395e51b2db8d580fcce96e9d0cb373c996f9114d02c452aa32db",
      "text": "制作人在吃甜甜圈！\n那是哪来的？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_c:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ec2f73f67d11be39f4580712c87e48ecc42efbd10135d82c64d670f9c71bca0",
      "text": "辛苦了，春名先生。\n刚才贤君给我的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d90f13e918ccd12e579c7a4b0d5454ff080aabc3df3ee7737f43b55afe646e0",
      "text": "这样啊！前阵子隼人也说受了我的影响\n想吃甜甜圈呢。总觉得好高兴啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea7ba78780568934e90983820d79afb018556f386c8bd445b587ab086a421b74",
      "text": "照这个势头，要是事务所的大家能更加\n喜欢甜甜圈就好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13e562ed3960c2e2f46795870e11cbb711c3ba9ee7757f3615c9f561cecff403",
      "text": "那样的话，贤买点心时买甜甜圈的\n次数会不会也变多啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42f2c300ae5d2192c15c3ce6d6162d11de038afc81ccb07ebe4ff9bc11c1007f",
      "text": "要是能那样就太好了呢。\n如果不介意的话，要来一个吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b44012e2877f165320d6afc6ced8d886c8101c73c72fb7e0d947c61abc5e9874",
      "text": "哦，可以吗？谢谢你，制作人！\n那我就开动啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_c:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75728422f56e430f4c56d919999f987fc92d368653a668b239a5738cee7a5099",
      "text": "嗯～！\n平常的甜甜圈也不错，不过这个甜甜圈也好好吃！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_d:cmd-000026:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:545b4975ef370b9b01f1beae8adcd5a2945bde9c6b354d6d10d9b9fa50b31412",
      "text": "距离生日还有一周……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3488d509183d25eda58c67c88d58e0a94d400982a7b2f6960426212b5860b593",
      "text": "那么，今天的练习就到这里！\n另外，我们有件事要通知春名。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ef680185cc0995615d111bf5fc1270c3a44d684530d7c397d5fd795d84700c6",
      "text": "春名亲的生日，我们居然\n要邀请你参加派对哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e4a700e306d6c3bd683ed33a8730d5fc9a8fe000099335fdb3bbb8e8887a6fa",
      "text": "虽然说是邀请，但其实是在事务所办啦。\n春名，你会来吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:441d677a2f7549c77a130b9b0429ca2c2c989fed2593f563bc28e7726199d081",
      "text": "真的吗！？我绝对去！\n谢啦，大家！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_d:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:427e15c8441874effb85b892a3048a1359a108614af199223b6cf4175d9053f4",
      "text": "绝妙的礼物……\n大家也在准备中……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_d:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bc7de04610c0dafe31180e2b62d66c0b5d09be33233ff5df223a7ae158f8951",
      "text": "是大家分工合作准备的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_d:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c33c3bf97db80e76d5a8e670e166441c69f87004a5f7f0bb3a218752902170b9",
      "text": "嘿，旬都这么说了，到底会是什么呢。\n超级期待啊，下周快点来吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_d:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff3e24c706b5b66eafc6ca784953cd5469743c652b4dcf5b6cedaf676d4fd6de",
      "text": "啊，当天因为要准备，所以我们会先去。\n春名你之后再慢悠悠地来事务所吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_d:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ded4128be357498d2eca766384e19ec8a857183d5611786faf8956afff768ed",
      "text": "哦，收到。\n主角只要压轴登场就行了对吧，交给我吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000033:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0caba00123987c65267cb553eff1c391af5c1350a25058166325804f0b0c7b21",
      "text": "生日当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e720de7db057f848a4719eb2f137d69dbf23c66873979ee8cc86edd499be3887",
      "text": "生日快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90a82ab4ac1505ea803a902d23dd6d6bdc591f62469ce345b31ad57d9555cda0",
      "text": "哈哈，事务所也变成派对模式了！\n大家，谢谢你们啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:468ad7b1778786fe23bc32686a37763ea2cdae78b986abcaeff830476ca3a14a",
      "text": "现在高兴还太早了哦。\n来，虽然有点仓促，但这是我们送的礼物！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:374a6e2dbb894d2d348d0e15ee0142095f4c116abe744937e55babe4d25b1f1e",
      "text": "哎！？那是……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f84faa006e31011b057293758529f1ae4668f52d796cf61c6044c0d3a484dc0",
      "text": "锵锵锵——！\n我精挑细选的！超绝Mega好吃甜甜圈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7de678e13c1ad2f78b879340b24b30c2179db25c3cc93d559a814277d600d52",
      "text": "每个人都选了各自认为最好吃的甜甜圈带来的。\n我们按顺序送给你吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf9aebf5b2a97dccf8954ceb2ea8c02ae86bc4b46e078477b588be6199514346",
      "text": "这是我挑的！\n是到处寻访试吃找到的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5330b7a6ab7deddd08ef8c8a23a202b1d14ba0e9a8aaae9962b69e5207925795",
      "text": "我的是，这个……\n做成了猫咪形状……很可爱……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4725186b0a3eed152ac1c017e8ed5b5edaa619f1c4255aaf8490cf2fa3229ab",
      "text": "这个是我送的。\n是百货商店限量销售的商品。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000170:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eed3305b8d92985a335cad910109c1d2435ae48a1bca71c1155a65d97bcfe56b",
      "text": "我的总而言之就是Mega华丽！超上镜！\n在社交平台上热度拉满的那款哦～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000180:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d793632e354644448d2bd57b37aa35e15669e6093765ecf6ba2d5615c3de13a3",
      "text": "我也准备了一份。\n我想春名先生也一定会喜欢的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000186:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4a6c5abed011247ec01b6485d3c29fe4c37ef79d9768181a1a50603e895cc46",
      "text": "大家，谢谢你们。\n我真的超级开心的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000192:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e82a8a70283635b1ea2a81ef557a95714808b808f8e423b2dadb5f60fa40aaea",
      "text": "想早点吃，但又觉得舍不得……\n不，我全都会好好品尝的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000206:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57f289833eedd8ee57cd4c710ef8d66f61b4123a2bb5c87e95feea4fdd6f0e1a",
      "text": "你能喜欢真是太好啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000211:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f826c0f2acc1eb47d9da29a56368f504f6177b3775a105eb10484f590832c3e",
      "text": "啊，不过不要吃得太急哦！\n被甜甜圈噎到的话，会非常难受的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000225:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8814558178b57bdb93b5a3db63decf280229101c79ac7586dcbc9d3c6effb52f",
      "text": "很有真实感呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000231:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:164205f65ce08136c1ac1c3e543fa2462d87ccb13353c6320384d9bed5f5d2ee",
      "text": "大家都很期待……让春名尝尝。\n……多吃点哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000263:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:270cc5e04448c7f40884a1cd61759f4f961e5b3411bacb955d765028d5e930ab",
      "text": "哦，那我可得好好品尝了。\n大家，真的太感谢了！这是最棒的生日！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
